# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# react-router-dom's createBrowserRouter uses real paths (e.g. /review/123).
# A hard refresh on a non-root path would 404 against a static host without
# this rule, because there is no /review/123 file in dist/. Returning
# index.html with status 200 lets the client-side router take over without
# the browser flashing a redirect.
#
# Status 200 is intentional (not 301/302) so the URL stays exactly as the
# user typed it.

/*    /index.html   200
